Package: mapycusmaximus
Title: Applies Focus-Glue-Context Fisheye Transformations for Spatial Visualization
Version: 0.1.0
Authors@R: 
    person("Alex", "Nguyen", , "thanhcuong10091992@gmail.com", role = c("aut", "cre", "cph"),
    person("Dianne", "Cook", "dicook@monash.edu", role = "aut"),
    person("Michael", "Lydeamore", "michael.lydeamore@monash.edu", role = "aut"))
Description: Focus-glue-context (FGC) fisheye transformations to two-dimensional coordinates and spatial vector geometries. Implements a smooth radial distortion that enlarges a focal region, transitions through a glue ring, and preserves outside context.
